        "code": "-- ভেরিয়েবল এবং ফাংশন সহ\nlocal env = {\n  pi = math.pi,\n  e  = math.exp(1),\n  x  = 10,\n  sqrt = math.sqrt,\n  sin  = math.sin,\n  cos  = math.cos,\n  abs  = math.abs,\n}\n\nprint(\"pi * x ^ 2    =\", calc(\"pi * x ^ 2\", env))\nprint(\"sqrt(144)      =\", calc(\"sqrt(144)\", env))\nprint(\"sin(pi / 2)    =\", calc(\"sin(pi / 2)\", env))\nprint(\"abs(-42) + e   =\", calc(\"abs(-42) + e\", env))",
